### 1. Prerequisites

Ensure your environment meets the following requirements:
- **DSH Version**: `^0.2.0-rc.1 || ^0.2.1-rc.1` (verified against `dsh-v0.2.0-rc.1` and `dsh-v0.2.1-rc.3`)
